insert into public.knowledge_chunks (document_id, position, content) select '00000000-0000-4000-8000-d0c000000013', 0, '[recipe:00000000-0000-4000-8000-0ec100000002] Crispy paprika potato wedges. Soaked, dried and lightly oiled wedges that come out crisp at the edges and fluffy inside. CookPilot demonstration recipe (not physically tested). Appliance: air-fryer. Compatible on paper with: AF101, AF300EU. Serves 2. Ingredients: 500 g Floury potatoes; 1 tbsp Neutral oil; 1 tsp Smoked paprika; 0.5 tsp Garlic powder; 0.5 tsp Fine sea salt 1. Cut the potatoes into even wedges, about 2 cm thick. Soak in cold water for 10 minutes, then drain and dry thoroughly in a clean towel. [10 min] 2. Toss the wedges with the oil, paprika, garlic powder and salt until evenly coated. 3. Cook on Air Fry at 200 °C for 10 minutes in a single, loose layer. [air-fry, 200 °C, 10 min] 4. Shake the basket well, then cook for 10–12 minutes more until golden and crisp. [air-fry, 200 °C, 11 min]' where exists (select 1 from public.knowledge_documents where id = '00000000-0000-4000-8000-d0c000000013') on conflict (document_id, position) do nothing;
