Safety: The basket and drawer are very hot after cooking — use the handle and place the drawer on a heat-proof surface.' where exists (select 1 from public.knowledge_documents where id = '00000000-0000-4000-8000-d0c000000013') on conflict (document_id, position) do nothing;

