insert into public.knowledge_chunks (document_id, position, content) select '00000000-0000-4000-8000-d0c000000017', 0, '[recipe:00000000-0000-4000-8000-0ec100000006] Grilled vegetable skewers with herb oil. Courgette, pepper, red onion and mushrooms, lightly charred and brushed with a lemony herb oil. CookPilot demonstration recipe (not physically tested). Appliance: indoor-grill. Compatible on paper with: AG301. Serves 2. Ingredients: 1 Courgette, in thick half-moons; 1 Red pepper, in 3 cm pieces; 1 Red onion, in wedges; 150 g Chestnut mushrooms; 2 tbsp Olive oil; 1 tbsp Lemon juice; 2 tbsp Chopped parsley and oregano; 0.5 tsp Fine sea salt 1. If you use wooden skewers, soak them in water for 15 minutes. Thread the vegetables, alternating colours, and brush with half the olive oil. Season with salt. 2. Fit the grill plate, close the lid and preheat on Grill, MED. [grill, MED] 3. Grill the skewers for 8–10 minutes, turning them halfway, until tender with charred edges. [grill, MED, 9 min] 4.' where exists (select 1 from public.knowledge_documents where id = '00000000-0000-4000-8000-d0c000000017') on conflict (document_id, position) do nothing;
insert into public.knowledge_chunks (document_id, position, content) select '00000000-0000-4000-8000-d0c000000017', 1, '3. Grill the skewers for 8–10 minutes, turning them halfway, until tender with charred edges. [grill, MED, 9 min] 4.
